  "details": "As I was flipping through tabs in the large menu, I hit the Search tab and my menu completely broke. It seems that selecting menu tabs too fast causes two menus to overlap on top of one another. \n\nI managed to correct it by selecting the Settings tab, and then randomly selecting the other tabs until the menu figured out there should only be one of itself. I have been unable to recreate the bug.\n\nThis was done on desktop, just trying out the new menu.",
